1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,560
Did you know

2
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:01,900
a SCALLOP can have

3
00:00:01,900 --> 00:00:03,620
up to 200 eyes?

4
00:00:03,620 --> 00:00:04,500
Those BLUE dots

5
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:05,380
along the edge

6
00:00:05,380 --> 00:00:06,440
of its shell?

7
00:00:06,440 --> 00:00:07,922
Each one is an EYE.

8
00:00:07,922 --> 00:00:09,500
Look INSIDE one.

9
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:10,480
Light passes through

10
00:00:10,480 --> 00:00:11,600
the eye and hits

11
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:12,520
a curved MIRROR

12
00:00:12,520 --> 00:00:13,392
at the back.

13
00:00:13,392 --> 00:00:14,840
Tiny SQUARE crystals

14
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:16,404
tile its surface.

15
00:00:16,404 --> 00:00:17,360
The mirror BOUNCES

16
00:00:17,360 --> 00:00:18,420
light back onto

17
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:19,820
a RETINA, like a

18
00:00:19,820 --> 00:00:21,880
little reflecting TELESCOPE.

19
00:00:21,880 --> 00:00:22,420
Can you spot

20
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:23,833
the EYES now?
